DE4SDV patch 0004 (optional, candidate "pr427"): DE4SDV's port of two fixes of upstream draft PR #427 onto the pin.

This is DE4SDV's port, not upstream's commit. It is applied only when the S-CORE build is asked for the variant
(DA_CANDIDATE=pr427, score-interface/series.sh), on top of 0001-0003 at the pin
014e0e7a56ee8e597c2cab8175233f74edd9b856. The default build (DA_CANDIDATE=pin) never reads it.

Source: autowarefoundation/vision_pilot PR #427 ("fix(planning): brake correctly for slower leads and ignore
guardrail phantoms"), a draft, head a38f227c475046e0119f30b05dac923a5043c8ee (125 commits ahead of and 74 behind the
pin). Only the hunks below are taken, with upstream's comments; nothing else of the PR (radar association, the fusion
rewrite, visualization, other configuration keys) is ported.

1. Closing-speed sign, upstream commit f06f84eb ("fix(planning): IDM closing speed is ego speed minus lead speed"):
   - VisionPilot/app/vision_pilot.cpp:177-179 at a38f227c (cipo_v = has_cipo ? ego_v + r->cipo.velocity_ms : ...,
     with its two comment lines) replaces vision_pilot.cpp:151 at the pin (cipo_v = has_cipo ? r->cipo.velocity_ms
     : ...); in the patched tree after 0001-0003 that line is 190.
   - VisionPilot/modules/safety_guardian/planning/src/longitudinal_planning.cpp:17 at a38f227c
     (delta_v = ego_v - cipo_v; // cipo_v is the lead's speed) replaces longitudinal_planning.cpp:17 at the pin
     (delta_v = cipo_v), under the comment at :16. The patched file is upstream's blob 3172cbe4 at a38f227c.

2. AD-only CIPO frames may continue a track but not start one, upstream commit a38f227c ("fix(fusion): AD-only CIPO
   may continue an AS-started track, not start one"), behind the configuration key fusion.ad_only_needs_as_track
   (default true; false restores the pin's behaviour):
   - longitudinal_fusion.hpp:95-100 at a38f227c (the Config member ad_only_needs_as_track with its comment) after
     reset_gate_m (longitudinal_fusion.hpp:52 at the pin), and :185 (the member as_track_) after initialised_ (:90 at
     the pin).
   - longitudinal_fusion.cpp:33 at a38f227c (reset() clears as_track_) after the pin's :33.
   - longitudinal_fusion.cpp:146-155 at a38f227c (as_track_, ad_only_allowed, ad_only_hit, the confirmation and the
     debug line) at the pin's AutoDrive confirmation, longitudinal_fusion.cpp:59-60. Adapted to the pin: the pin's
     camera-only fusion has no radar branch and names AutoSpeed's selected CIPO cipo_raw (upstream as_h), and the pin
     confirms AutoDrive only at flag_prob >= CIPO_PROB_MIN, so that gate is kept in the confirmation; upstream's
     "as_cipo_box ||" AutoSpeed vouching for AutoDrive below that flag (f5f626a8) is not ported.
   - as_cipo_box, the definition of "AutoSpeed vehicle box" that ad_only_hit reads, is taken from
     longitudinal_fusion.cpp:72-77 at a38f227c (introduced by f5f626a8), without its radar comment.
   - vision_pilot_config.cpp:125-126 at a38f227c (parse fusion.ad_only_needs_as_track, default "true") after the pin's
     :124. Upstream writes cfg.inference.long_fusion.ad_only_needs_as_track; the pin's models::Config has no
     long_fusion member, so the port carries the value as models::Config::fusion_ad_only_needs_as_track
     (inference.hpp:25 at the pin) into the fusion's Config where inference.cpp:107 builds it, the way the pin carries
     fusion.debug. Upstream's vision_pilot.conf at a38f227c names no such key: the default lives in the parse call and
     the Config member, as upstream has it.

Why (INC-DRIVING-002 decision D4, the second candidate): the p10-2 attempt-3 diagnosis replayed the pin's planner on
the logged inputs; the closing speed entered the IDM with the wrong sign, and AD-only CIPOs from the guardrail in
curves commanded hard braking. Recreate this file's body with the steps in score-interface/check_patch.sh.

